  "question": {
    "text": "If the normals at two points <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> of a parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> intersect at a third point <math><mi>R</mi></math> on the parabola&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, then the product of the ordinates of <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>then <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are roots of the equation <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> product of the ordinates of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
